        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/theark/scene_magpie.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 52cfd5fd-b9b9-454a-8c7c-8a218501d3b4).Image",
        "Description": "47,\r\rI have recieved word that the Constant has recently undergone facial reconstructive surgery via Haven Island. Apparently, he is posing as a guard, tonight, in the Isle of Sgail! Do not be fooled by his decoy, who is said to be roaming the castle, wearing the Constant&apos;s original face. I have done my best to narrow down the suspects to the three most likely culprits. God speed, 47, it&apos;s the eleventh hour already.",
